OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AKemi Badenoch has cemented her image.
OL,4,ANow she wants to put her party back on
OL,5,Athe big stage
OL,6,
OL,7,FSo, Kemi Badenoch will tread the same
OL,8,Fstage ageing rockers Marillion took
OL,9,Flast month - and where sequinned
OL,10,Fsoprano Katherine Jenkins will perform
OL,11,Fnext week. She'll also avoid the
OL,12,Fhumiliation of a national party leader
OL,13,Fbeing squashed into a side room at a
OL,14,Fcorporate conference centre (with
OL,15,Fdrapes portioning off the empty space).
OL,16,FSimply, the party is able to put bums
OL,17,Fon seats again - and by that measure,
OL,18,Fthings are looking up.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
