OL,3,AKemi Badenoch has cemented her image.
OL,4,ANow she wants to put her party back on
OL,5,Athe big stage
OL,6,
OL,7,FBadenoch goes into the conference with
OL,8,Fher own position secure in the party.
OL,9,FOne senior Tory says "she has actually
OL,10,Fdefied cynics like me" who initially
OL,11,Fdisapproved of her leadership. Her
OL,12,Fstanding with the public has improved
OL,13,Fand she is now, again on a very simple
OL,14,Fbut crucial measure, much better known.
OL,15,FHer allies are sure she has developed a
OL,16,Fclear identity among the public,
OL,17,Fconfiding: "People now know who she is
OL,18,Fand they enjoy her interventions - the
OL,19,Fthing we hear most is I don't always
OL,20,Fagree with her but I know where she
OL,21,Fstands."
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
