OL,3,A'Anger in the streets': Tens of
OL,4,Athousands protest in Spain over housing
OL,5,Acrisis
OL,6,
OL,7,FThousands of protesters have taken to
OL,8,Fthe streets across Spain calling for
OL,9,Fgreater protections for tenants after
OL,10,Fthe government failed to get emergency
OL,11,Fhousing legislation through parliament
OL,12,Fon Friday.
OL,14,FAbout 50 planned marches are taking
OL,15,Fplace on Saturday in cities including
OL,16,FMadrid, Valencia and Barcelona.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
